{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（20日）上午11時03分，警方接報，指元朗公路往上水方向近朗天路，有一輛警車懷疑起火。消防到場出動兩條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，並於約16分鐘後將火救熄。網上影片可見，一輛俗稱「豬籠車」用作運送警員的警車，冒出白煙並停在路邊，消防員正在撲救。</p><p>現場消息指，「豬籠車」在行駛途中，懷疑引擎突然起火。</p><figure><img alt=\"「豬籠車」的引擎蓋擱在路邊。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189182943583670272805764.jpeg/DSM5Hc4VN9kaRcw9RmLfe0DRXq3OprXFOR1DfBwdQ3w\"/><figcaption>「豬籠車」的引擎蓋擱在路邊。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「豬籠車」的車頭熏黑。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189182940702052352782634.jpeg/_9vqNepclfsqvWIx8FyLy5W2E3e2pWTRMhresRca3rE\"/><figcaption>「豬籠車」的車頭熏黑。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189182949112025088721806.jpeg/pQJw5XHSMWlKF9rnVEMNTFGYJlGZdSY09e67K9Duuys\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一輛「豬籠車」在行駛途中起火。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189182946532397056076514.jpeg/kEucqgKzOA7DK4tF1mxH8ARTL0WS_woHy34yse5-MrE\"/><figcaption>一輛「豬籠車」在行駛途中起火。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><p>運輸署宣布，因車輛着火，元朗公路（往上水方向）近朗天路的部份行車線現已封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車。現時上址交通繁忙。</p><figure><img alt=\"一輛「豬籠車」冒煙。（香港交通及突發事故報料區/ Chileung Mo影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189183110978211840174258.png/-KwU68oKme4fT89FnpDZ2VjKdKR-Dsz42HbFWNh2xVg\"/><figcaption>一輛「豬籠車」冒煙。（香港交通及突發事故報料區/ Chileung Mo影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防車在場候命。（香港交通及突發事故報料區/ Chileung Mo影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189183113381679104349026.png/AGStLaRIqsZCJCYewZSceQbmPswCdS-gRqjTdUao03U\"/><figcaption>消防車在場候命。（香港交通及突發事故報料區/ Chileung Mo影片截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.659504+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":369,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T03:44:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T14:18:11.334253+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:13.385194+00:00","content_hash":"2140c999b36e6d6c605babb48af005499106e95643ffa05b393c3d39634b1a10","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}